0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Dehya","r":[0.0815,0.5126,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.1231,0.5126,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Kaedehara Kazuha","r":[0.1648,0.5126,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.2065,0.5126,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Dehya","r":[0.0815,0.5637,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Emilie","r":[0.1231,0.5637,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.1648,0.5637,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Kaedehara Kazuha","r":[0.2065,0.5637,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Dehya","r":[0.0815,0.6148,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Raiden Shogun","r":[0.1231,0.6148,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Chevreuse","r":[0.1648,0.6148,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.2065,0.6148,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Dehya","r":[0.0815,0.6719,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Xiangling","r":[0.1231,0.6719,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.1648,0.6719,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.2065,0.6719,0.0343,0.0274]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/dehya/261112-182845/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Beacon of the Reed Sea","text":"High CRIT Rate and ATK buffs when Skill hits or Dehya takes damage; boosts HP when unshielded. Best for on-field damage; avoid shields for the HP passive."},{"name":"Wolf's Gravestone","text":"Large ATK bonus and a teamwide ATK buff against low-HP enemies; straightforward Burst damage. Team ATK buff activates below 30% enemy HP."},{"name":"Redhorn Stonethresher","text":"Very high CRIT DMG helps Burst builds, but its DEF-based Normal and Charged Attack passive does not buff Burst punches. Primarily a CRIT stat stick."},{"name":"Skyward Pride","text":"Energy Recharge helps costly Burst rotations; high base ATK supports her punches. Vacuum blades require Normal or Charged Attacks and do not trigger from Burst punches."},{"name":"Akuoumaru","text":"Boosts Burst damage based on the total Energy costs of the team, suiting high-cost Burst lineups. Best with high combined team Burst costs. High refinements improve value."},{"name":"Serpent Spine","text":"CRIT Rate and stacking damage bonus can strengthen Burst DPS; stacks are harder to maintain when taking hits. A shielder helps retain stacks, but blocks some Beacon/Vourukasha synergies. Higher refinements increase damage."},{"name":"Favonius Greatsword","text":"Generates neutral particles with on-field CRIT hits, helping teammates and offering ER for Dehya. Support utility; build enough CRIT Rate to trigger. Refinements help proc reliability."},{"name":"Tidal Shadow","text":"Craftable ATK claymore; its ATK buff activates after Dehya receives healing, making it useful with a healer. Requires healing to activate the passive."}],"a":[{"names":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"text":"A consistent Burst-focused set: Energy Recharge and Burst DMG fit her high-cost on-field rotation.","stats":"ER% / ATK% · Pyro DMG · CRIT"},{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"HP changes grant CRIT Rate during on-field play; strong with Furina or reliable self-damage and healing.","stats":"ER% / ATK% · Pyro DMG · CRIT DMG"},{"names":["Vourukasha's Glow"],"text":"Boosts Skill and Burst damage after Dehya takes damage; stronger with reliable stacks and lower ER needs.","stats":"ATK% / ER% · Pyro DMG · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Flame-Mane Encore","members":["Dehya","Furina","Kaedehara Kazuha","Bennett"],"text":"Furina enables Vaporize and damage buffs, Kazuha shreds Pyro RES, and Bennett buffs and heals Dehya. Manage Furina team HP.","roles":["Burst DPS","Hydro Sub DPS / Buffer","Anemo Buffer","Healer / ATK Buffer"]},{"name":"Burn Notice","members":["Dehya","Emilie","Bennett","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Burning activates Emilie while Dehya drives Pyro damage. Bennett powers Burst; Kazuha groups and shreds Pyro RES.","roles":["Burst DPS","Burning Sub DPS","Healer / ATK Buffer","Anemo Buffer"]},{"name":"Overload and Out","members":["Dehya","Raiden Shogun","Chevreuse","Fischl"],"text":"Chevreuse amplifies Pyro/Electro teams, Fischl supplies off-field Electro, and Raiden helps recharge Dehya’s costly Burst.","roles":["Burst DPS","Electro DPS / Battery","Overload Buffer / Healer","Electro Sub DPS"]},{"name":"Budget Fire Brigade","members":["Dehya","Xiangling","Bennett","Sucrose"],"text":"An accessible Mono Pyro core: Bennett batteries and buffs, Xiangling adds damage, and Sucrose groups and shreds Pyro RES.","roles":["Burst DPS","Pyro Sub DPS","Healer / Battery","Anemo Driver / VV"]}],"v":"Furina Burst DPS: Marechaussee Hunter with Furina; adjust CRIT Rate for its 36% bonus and keep enough ER for every Burst.\nHigh-Investment Burst: Vourukasha's Glow becomes attractive with reliable damage stacks and lower ER needs, especially at C4+.\nDefensive Support: Tenacity of the Millelith + Favonius Greatsword; prioritize HP% and CRIT Rate for team protection and energy.\nBurgeon Trigger: Flower of Paradise Lost or Gilded Dreams with EM/EM/EM. Slow Skill hits mean Burgeon is supplemental.\nAccessible Burst: Tidal Shadow or Akuoumaru plus Emblem; run Bennett and a Pyro battery for reliable rotations.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS / Support"],"about":"Dehya is a flexible Pyro bruiser who unleashes Burst punches or protects allies with DMG mitigation and interruption resistance. Her on-field DMG needs substantial ER and investment; off-field support and Burgeon instead focus on her Skill. Her Burst punches do not trigger Normal Attack-linked effects.","pros":["Damage mitigation","Interruption resistance","Flexible team roles","Self-healing passive"],"cons":["High Burst energy needs","Slow off-field Pyro","Limited Burst synergies","C0 damage is modest"],"weapons":["Beacon of the Reed Sea","Wolf's Gravestone","Redhorn Stonethresher","Skyward Pride","Akuoumaru","Serpent Spine","Favonius Greatsword","Tidal Shadow"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Burst DPS"},{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"With Furina"},{"sets":["Vourukasha's Glow"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Invested DPS"}],"main":["Energy Recharge / ATK% (HP% at C1)","Pyro DMG Bonus","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["CRIT Rate: 60% - 75%","CRIT DMG: 120% - 180%+","Energy Recharge: 150% - 225%","ATK: 1,600 - 2,100+","HP: 25,000 - 35,000+ (C1/support)"],"vars":[{"title":"Furina Vaporize Burst","role":"On-field Burst DPS","weapons":["Beacon of the Reed Sea","Wolf's Gravestone","Tidal Shadow"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Build enough ER to Burst every rotation, then CRIT and ATK. Marechaussee adds up to 36% CRIT Rate; avoid overcapping.","teams":"Furina with dependable healing, plus Pyro energy support; Kazuha or another RES shredder helps.","when":"Choose this for an invested on-field Dehya with reliable HP fluctuations and Furina buffs.","cond":"Furina + consistent HP changes; Burst punches cannot trigger Xingqiu/Yelan Burst attacks.","notes":"Furina application, reaction frequency and ER needs vary by rotation; test your exact team.","pre":false},{"title":"High-Constellation Burst","role":"On-field Burst DPS","weapons":["Beacon of the Reed Sea","Wolf's Gravestone","Akuoumaru"],"arts":[{"sets":["Vourukasha's Glow"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"C1 makes HP% more valuable; C4 reduces ER burden, permitting more CRIT and offensive stats.","teams":"Pyro battery and healing; Dehya needs to take damage for Vourukasha stacks.","when":"For players with C4–C6 who can maintain damage-taken stacks and Burst uptime.","cond":"Damage must reach Dehya; shield-heavy teams can reduce set uptime.","notes":"Emblem is still a dependable alternative, especially when ER demands stay high.","pre":false},{"title":"Off-Field Defensive Support","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Favonius Greatsword","Sacrificial Greatsword","Wolf's Gravestone"],"arts":[{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"HP% / HP% / HP% for mitigation; use CRIT Rate circlet with Favonius. Little or no Burst ER required.","teams":"An on-field ally who values interruption resistance and Pyro application. Team may still need healing.","when":"Pick this for Skill-based protection and Tenacity ATK buffs instead of Dehya’s personal damage.","cond":"Her Skill has downtime; defensive mitigation is not a full substitute for healing.","notes":"Skill coordinated hits maintain Tenacity during field uptime. Instructor is a lower-rarity reaction alternative.","pre":false},{"title":"Burgeon Skill Trigger","role":"Off-field Reaction DPS","weapons":["Mailed Flower","Makhaira Aquamarine","Favonius Greatsword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Flower of Paradise Lost"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"EM / EM / EM; prioritize character level 90 and EM, with HP% if more protection is needed. No Burst ER required.","teams":"Hydro and Dendro sources to produce Bloom cores plus a healer or additional sustain.","when":"Use Dehya’s Skill to trigger occasional Burgeons without using Burst.","cond":"Coordinated Skill hits are slow and may miss cores; Burgeon performance is limited.","notes":"Do not recommend her as an especially consistent sole Burgeon trigger.","pre":false},{"title":"F2P-Friendly Burst","role":"On-field Burst DPS","weapons":["Tidal Shadow","Akuoumaru","Luxurious Sea-Lord"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER Sands if needed, Pyro DMG Goblet, CRIT Circlet; balance ER before damage.","teams":"Bennett and preferably Xiangling or another Pyro teammate for particles; healer required for Tidal Shadow.","when":"For accessible weapon options while retaining Dehya’s on-field Burst playstyle.","cond":"Tidal Shadow needs healing; Luxurious Sea-Lord is an old limited event weapon.","notes":"Lower-constellation Burst damage is modest; prioritize comfortable rotations over perfect CRIT rolls.","pre":false}],"mats":["Agnidus Agate Sliver","Agnidus Agate Fragment","Agnidus Agate Chunk","Agnidus Agate Gemstone","Light Guiding Tetrahedron","Teachings of Praxis","Guide to Praxis","Philosophies of Praxis","Faded Red Satin","Trimmed Red Silk","Rich Red Brocade","Sand Grease Pupa","Puppet Strings","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 8-9"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8-9"}],"teams":[{"name":"Flame-Mane Encore","members":["Dehya","Furina","Kaedehara Kazuha","Bennett"]},{"name":"Burn Notice","members":["Dehya","Emilie","Bennett","Kaedehara Kazuha"]},{"name":"Overload and Out","members":["Dehya","Raiden Shogun","Chevreuse","Fischl"]},{"name":"Budget Fire Brigade","members":["Dehya","Xiangling","Bennett","Sucrose"]}]}}],"title":"Dehya","el":"Pyro"}